*does not** narrate the complete process of the **2020 Oscars ceremony**. It is a **compilation** that includes moments from **multiple Oscars ceremonies**, including at least the **2019 (91st)** and **2020 (92nd)** Academy Awards.\n\n**Therefore, answer '1' is INCORRECT.**\n\n--- \n\n**Final Answer: ❌ No, the video does not narrate the complete process of the 2020 Oscars ceremony. It is a compilation of moments from multiple ceremonies, including the 2019 and 2020 Oscars.**\n", "\n=== Batch 60-77 (17 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_3910.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_3911.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_3912.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_3913.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_3914.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_3915.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4073.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4074.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4075.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4076.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4077.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4078.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4079.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4080.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4081.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4082.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/-WnyRMZqV1U/frames/frame_4083.jpg\nVLM Response: Based on the visual evidence provided in the 17 frames, the answer **'1' — “The entire video narrates the complete process of the 2020 Oscars ceremony” — is NOT correct.**\n\nHere’s the detailed verif